{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46322","headline":"杨花 · 齐己","name":"杨花","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暖景照悠悠，遮空势渐稠。\n乍如飞雪远，未似落花休。\n万带都门外，千株渭水头。\n纷纭知近夏，销歇恐成秋。\n软着朝簪去，狂随别骑游。\n斾冲离馆驿，莺扑绕宫楼。\n江国晴愁对，池塘晚见浮。\n虚窗萦笔雅，深院藉苔幽。\n静堕王孙酒，繁黏客子裘。\n咏吟何洁白，根本属风流。\n向日还轻举，因风更自由。\n不堪思汴岸，千里到扬州。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46322.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46322","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}